<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals committee to focus on routine issues.</title>
<headline>EU cereals committee to focus on routine issues.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The last European Union cereals management committee of the month, to be held on Thursday, will be routine, an EU member state official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be no meeting next week and some end of month items have been brought forward, but it is all routine,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>Apart from the usual rice tenders, the committee will decide the aid rates for transporting rice to the Canaries and Madeira.</p>
<p>Aid for transporting cereals to the Canaries and Madeira and to French overseas territories will also be decided ahead of schedule, the official said. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
